From 5dcc505f08aacbdb4147e84819c02e6f10fca257 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Witold=20Gre=C5=84?= <witold.gren@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:53:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] ws: PIR sensitivity, recording, post-record time, alarm
 sound, event snapshot

Core: RecordCfg (54/55), Record (81/82) and AudioTask (231/232) xml with
get/set, a generic probe(msg_id) for discovering what a camera supports.

ws state: pir_sensitivity, pir_reduce_false_alarm, recording,
post_record (+ allowed values), alarm_sound, read passively on connect;
commands to set each. A motion push notification now also keeps a still
of the event (<camera>.event.jpg, /snapshot/<camera>?event=true,
event_snapshot_at). Probe command for diagnostics.

Tested on a Reolink Go Plus (firmware v3.0.0.662).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
